  "description": "Transport-neutral client kernel for Canton participant nodes: OAuth2 client-credentials and static token providers implementing Canton.Ledger.Abstractions.ITokenProvider, the OpenTelemetry ActivitySource naming convention, an opt-in Polly retry pipeline, and the shared transaction-tree assembler, exercise-outcome folds and malformed-response vocabulary, consumed as peers by both the gRPC and HTTP clients.",
